@startuml census_zcta
title census_zcta: ZIP Code Tabulation Area gazetteer
start
:try <year>_Gaz_zcta_national.zip for the last 3 years;
repeat
  :download the newest candidate (cached);
repeat while (a zip?) is (no: HTML stub, try the previous vintage)
-> yes;
:extract the national .txt (one shard unit);
note right: pipe-separated in 2026, tab-separated in older vintages;\nDuckDB sniffs the delimiter
:census_zcta_gazetteer
(national file verbatim, all columns text, names lower-cased);
:dbt: stg_census_zcta__gazetteer (typed columns, vintage from file name)
-> dim_zcta (Missouri prefixes 630-658);
:frontend: "find my officials by ZIP" matches the internal point
against district polygons in the browser;
stop
@enduml
